course: dictionary
lesson: 349
title: Answer: a reply, a result, or a response
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: An answer is what you say or write back when someone asks a question. It can also be the result of a sum: when you finish 7 + 5, the answer is 12. The word can also be a verb, to answer, which means to reply, or to pick up the phone or open the door when someone calls or knocks.
explain: The words around answer tell you which meaning fits. «Check your answer» in maths means look again at your result. «Answer the door» means go and open it. The context clues make the meaning clear, so ask yourself what would fit.
explain: In Alice, the Cat answers, «I'd rather not». Here answer means reply. Swap in reply and the sentence still makes sense, which is a good check to use.
fact: An answer is what you give back to a question, or the result of a sum or problem.
fact: To answer means to reply, or to pick up the phone or open the door when someone calls or knocks.
fact: «Dǎnxiǎoguǐ» means scaredy-cat, and the answer to being dared is «wǒ cái bú pà!», which means "I'm not scared!"
fact: In Ohio, a family left a pan of oil on the hob and went to answer the door. When someone threw water on the fire, it burst up and burnt the kitchen, so never throw water on a fat or oil fire.
fact: AI means artificial intelligence: computer programs that do tasks like talking, sorting or answering.
exercise: In Alice, the Cat answers, «I'd rather not». What does answers mean here? | To shout loudly | To fall asleep | To pay for something | *To reply
exercise: In maths, «check your answer» means what? | *Look again to see if your result is right | Write the question again | Give the work to someone else | Throw the work away
exercise: Mum calls the front door, and there is «no answer». What has happened? | The door has been painted | Someone has sung back | *Nobody has come to the door or picked up | Mum has won a prize
test: Which word means the same as answer when you reply to a question? | *Reply | Hide | Forget | Shout
test: What does «answer the phone» mean? | Throw the phone away | *Pick up the phone when it rings | Dial a number to ring someone | Sing a song to a friend
exam: In «AI means... computer programs that do tasks like talking, sorting or answering», answering means: | Growing | *Replying to people | Blinking | Eating
